
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Join Us | Sign Up</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
}

body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background: #080808;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    padding: 25px 15px;
    color: white;
}

/* Animated background */
body::before,
body::after {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    width: 350px;
    height: 350px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(100px);
    opacity: 0.3;
    animation: float 7s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
    pointer-events: none;
}

body::before {
    background: #ffcc00;
    top: -100px;
    left: -100px;
}

body::after {
    background: #ff9900;
    bottom: -100px;
    right: -100px;
    animation-delay: 2s;
}

@keyframes float {
    from { transform: translate(0, 0); }
    to { transform: translate(80px, 60px); }
}

/* Signup container */
.container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 430px;
    background: rgba(25, 25, 25, 0.92);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.35);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 35px 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.12);
    backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    animation: appear 1s ease;
}

@keyframes appear {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(40px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

.logo {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #ffcc00;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 15px #ffcc00;
}

.subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

h2 span {
    color: #ffcc00;
}

form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 17px;
}

.input-group label {
    display: block;
    color: #ddd;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.input-group input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px;
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid #444;
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: white;
    font-size: 14px;
    outline: none;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.input-group input:focus {
    border-color: #ffcc00;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.3);
    transform: scale(1.02);
}

.input-group input::placeholder {
    color: #777;
}

.terms {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #aaa;
    align-items: center;
}

.terms input {
    accent-color: #ffcc00;
}

.terms a {
    color: #ffcc00;
    text-decoration: none;
}

button {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 15px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffcc00, #ff9900);
    color: #080808;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.3s;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.25);
}

button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.6);
}

.login {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 23px;
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.login a {
    color: #ffcc00;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-decoration: none;
}

.footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 25px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 11px;
}

/* Mobile adjustments */
@media(max-width: 400px) {
    .container {
        padding: 28px 20px;
    }

    .logo {
        font-size: 25px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <div class="logo">YOUR BRAND</div>
    <p class="subtitle">CREATE YOUR ACCOUNT</p>

    <h2>Join <span>Us Today</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Sign up and become part of something amazing.</p>

    <form action="#" method="post">

        <div class="input-group">
            <label>Full Name</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Enter your full name" required>
        </div>

        <div class="input-group">
            <label>Email Address</label>
            <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required>
        </div>

        <div class="input-group">
            <label>Username</label>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Choose a username" required>
        </div>

        <div class="input-group">
            <label>Password</label>
            <input type="password" placeholder="Create a password"
            minlength="8" required>
        </div>

        <div class="input-group">
            <label>Confirm Password</label>
            <input type="password" placeholder="Confirm your password"
            minlength="8" required>
        </div>

        <div class="terms">
            <input type="checkbox" required>
            <span>I agree to the <a href="#">Terms & Conditions</a></span>
        </div>

        <button type="submit">CREATE ACCOUNT →</button>

    </form>

    <p class="login">
        Already have an account?
        <a href="#">Login</a>
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
        © 2026 YOUR BRAND. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
